### What parser are you using?

Default (Espree)

### What did you do?

<details>
<summary>Configuration</summary>

```js
export default [
    {
        rules: {
            "no-unsafe-finally": "error",
        },
    },
];
```
</details>

```js
function foo() {
  outer: for (let i = 0; i < 1; i++) {
    try {
      return 1;
    } finally {
      for (let j = 0; j < 1; j++) {
        continue outer; // Not reported
      }
    }
  }

  return 2;
}

foo(); // 2
```


### What did you expect to happen?

The labeled `continue` statement should be reported as unsafe.

### What actually happened?

No error was reported.

